+// library in two child processes (one per side) that die of their capped stack within
+// milliseconds, but each is a test binary started afresh (about 90 ms), so the property runs
+// a fifth of the default count (HEGEL_TEST_CASES scales it) and its shrink is capped at
+// ancestorLinkAttempts failing attempts (two children each).
+const (
+	ancestorLinkCount    = 20
+	ancestorLinkAttempts = 40
+)
